@startuml
!include style.iuml
title UC-3: Team Formation and Management
left to right direction

actor "Student" as S
actor "Team Leader" as TL
actor "Team Member" as TM
actor "Supervisor" as SV
actor "Sub Admin" as SB

S <|-- TL

rectangle "AI Project Supervisor" {
  usecase "Choose Individual or\nTeam Project" as U30
  usecase "Create Project Team" as U31
  usecase "Invite Registered Students" as U32
  usecase "Accept or Reject Invitation" as U33
  usecase "View Team Members and\nMembership Status" as U34
  usecase "Remove Team Member" as U35
  usecase "Designate Team Leader" as U36
  usecase "View Assigned\nResponsibilities" as U37
  usecase "Resolve Team\nManagement Issues" as U38
}

S -- U30
S -- U33
S -- U37
TL -- U31
TL -- U32
TL -- U34
TL -- U35
TL -- U36
TM -- U37
TM -- U34
SV -- U35
U38 -- SB

U31 .> U30 : <<extend>>
U35 ..> U34 : <<include>>
U36 ..> U34 : <<include>>

note bottom of U31
  The project creator becomes the
  initial Team Leader. Exactly one
  Team Leader exists per team.
end note

note bottom of U35
  Supervisor role: review and oversight
  of removals (Review in RBAC matrix).
end note
@enduml
